WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:07,370
Brother Qin, I don’t know how to repay you

2
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:10,370
How about I help you clean up the cave and wash your clothes?

3
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:14,330
Silly girl, I don’t need you to repay me

4
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:16,460
Take good care of Shenzi and Xiaoshan

5
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:19,460
If something happens in the future, don’t take it upon yourself, come to me

6
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,540
Brother Qin

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:26,788
A Tian

8
00:00:26,788 --> 00:00:48,030
I heard Lao Sun say that you always run into the mountains.

9
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:50,030
Have you got anything good?

10
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:52,030
Uncle Ergou was joking

11
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:54,030
I just chop wood and cut mushrooms

12
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:56,030
Hunting requires proper arrangements and a gun

13
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:59,130
Qin Laosun has a few truths in his mouth
